          "fields": {
            "rarity": "5 \u2605",
            "type": "Item Virtual"
          },
          "text": "A curious keystone that serves as a repository of brilliant hues.\nIn a wondrous domain filled with beauty and mystery, myriad stories from a witch's long sojourns in foreign lands are sealed. By harnessing the power of this wondrous item, you can reveal these brilliant treasures to the world once more..."
