          "text": "A crystal geode that serves as a template to reproduce splendor.\nIn a mystical realm where anything can take shape, it is imbued with a witch's insights into the true essence of clothing. By harnessing the power of this wondrous item, you can re-create many a marvelous cosmetic..."
