          "fields": {
            "rarity": "5 \u2605",
            "type": "Item Virtual"
          },
          "text": "A bright, translucent keystone that can be used to perform Event Odes.\nIn a wondrous domain replete with luminous splendor, every corner is filled with exquisite forms arranged by a witch. By harnessing the power of this wondrous item, you can re-create many a marvelous cosmetic..."
