          "text": "A serving of Gebratenes Fleisch mit Sauerkraut that has already been packed. A curious smell wafts from within.\nYou've heard that this is a hidden menu item that only long-time patrons know of and that the hoi polloi cannot appreciate its flavor \u2014 fair enough, you think..."
