          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605",
            "type": "Item Material"
          },
          "text": "This gift box contains an exquisite outfit. Due to the personal customization that has taken place, its dimensions and make only perfectly fit one.\n\nCondition: Reach Adventure Rank 5.\n\nWhen used: Select and obtain 1 of the outfits within the gift box."
