          "art": "../../Database/GameData/gi/assets/items/UI_ItemIcon_120259.webp",
          "fields": {
            "rarity": "Unknown",
            "type": "Quest Item"
          },
          "text": "To Collei, the only flower that can serve as her Windblume and convey her gratitude and well-wishes is the Padisarah. She now offers their seeds to you.\nIn visiting Mondstadt again, Collei has taken a tentative step toward the future. May her coming days be as a small seed held within her palm, filled deep with the potential for light and hope."
