          "text": "A fragment of a weapon once wielded by Sanhaj Kompore, Border Master of the Masters of the Night-Wind. It was broken into its currents state during the great war five hundred years past. According to Granny Itztli's intuition, it may aid the Traveler in some inexplicable way at some future point in their journey."
