          "fields": {
            "rarity": "4 \u2605",
            "type": "Adventure Item"
          },
          "text": "Collect all 3 seals to unlock the treasure vault on Hiisi Island.\n\nYou found this round, marked stone by chance while exploring. If you collect three with the same markings, you may be able to piece together a shadow of the bright moon that once illuminated the world."
