          "fields": {
            "rarity": "Unknown",
            "type": "Quest Item"
          },
          "text": "A sacred lamp capable of forming a protective barrier, its faint light barely piercing the darkness.\nOnce a ritual vessel of the Frostmoon Scions, it brought dreams and song to the lost people wandering the desolate lands. It has survived to this day only because it was left behind in the time-stilled tower."
