          "text": "Namecard style.\nThis bears all the marks of that fellow who gallivants as he pleases across the continent with his ever-changing combat styles. Yet, his \"Foul Legacy\" was not originally his. Rather, it was taught to him by that solitary girl who dwelt in the darkest corners of the universe."
